KG42.register("slice-clusters-ecde018854d949b9483e7790",{"id":"08-real_time_prices::v142-d-CL001","paper":"08-real_time_prices","title":"Bid-free price-responsive participation by small consumers and DER","source_pointer":"/clusters/28","node_ids":["COMP-5662f1d03d6b9b67","COMP-42adfdfb6dfa84b0","COMP-ab3d11c48c98c7be","COMP-f66e9ec7493cbb66","KG31-c53b1d455f59fded","COMP-5e870d267afec9a0"],"rule_refs":["08-real_time_prices::v141-c-R001","08-real_time_prices::v141-c-R002","08-real_time_prices::v141-c-R005","08-real_time_prices::v141-c-R006","08-real_time_prices::v141-c-R004"],"visible_rule_refs":["08-real_time_prices::v141-c-R001","08-real_time_prices::v141-c-R002","08-real_time_prices::v141-c-R005","08-real_time_prices::v141-c-R006","08-real_time_prices::v141-c-R004"],"suppressed_rule_refs":[],"edges":[{"global_edge_id":"S-19abacbc3fbe45b6","source":"COMP-ab3d11c48c98c7be","target":"COMP-f66e9ec7493cbb66","type":"links","assertion_ids":["08-real_time_prices::v141-c-R005::E::v141-c-R005-E001"],"rule_refs":["08-real_time_prices::v141-c-R005"],"internal":false},{"global_edge_id":"S-ded5b6cd15f39921","source":"COMP-ab3d11c48c98c7be","target":"KG31-c53b1d455f59fded","type":"links","assertion_ids":["08-real_time_prices::v141-c-R006::E::v141-c-R006-E001"],"rule_refs":["08-real_time_prices::v141-c-R006"],"internal":false},{"global_edge_id":"S-6f0dd3fd2acf7b68","source":"COMP-42adfdfb6dfa84b0","target":"COMP-ab3d11c48c98c7be","type":"precedes","assertion_ids":["08-real_time_prices::v141-c-R004::E::v141-c-R004-E001"],"rule_refs":["08-real_time_prices::v141-c-R004"],"internal":false},{"global_edge_id":"S-08125d031225f6a2","source":"COMP-5e870d267afec9a0","target":"COMP-ab3d11c48c98c7be","type":"links","assertion_ids":["08-real_time_prices::v141-c-R004::E::v141-c-R004-E002"],"rule_refs":["08-real_time_prices::v141-c-R004"],"internal":false}],"unresolved_rule_refs":[],"interface_annotations":[{"connection_id":"v142-d-CON001","from_chain_id":"v141-c-R001","to_chain_id":"v141-c-R002","kind":"complementary_scope","from_refs":["v141-c-R001::phi::v141-c-R001-C001"],"to_refs":["v141-c-R002::phi::v141-c-R002-C001"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-ev18"],"rationale":"The same bid-free design covers demand-side and supply-side submission behavior separately, and the two are complementary; constraints on different sides are not classified as duplicate objects merely because they share a source."},{"connection_id":"v142-d-CON002","from_chain_id":"v141-c-R001","to_chain_id":"v141-c-R005","kind":"complementary_scope","from_refs":["v141-c-R001::phi::v141-c-R001-C001"],"to_refs":["v141-c-R005::phi::v141-c-R005-C001","v141-c-R005::phi::v141-c-R005-C002"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-ev18","v141-b-g03-e07"],"rationale":"The market-level exclusion of demand submissions and consumer participation through response to received prices complement each other, forming a mode of participation that requires no bid submission, rather than adding a new admission dependency edge."},{"connection_id":"v142-d-CON003","from_chain_id":"v141-c-R002","to_chain_id":"v141-c-R006","kind":"complementary_scope","from_refs":["v141-c-R002::phi::v141-c-R002-C001","v141-c-R002::phi::v141-c-R002-C002"],"to_refs":["v141-c-R006::phi::v141-c-R006-C001","v141-c-R006::phi::v141-c-R006-C002"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-ev09","v141-b-g01-ev18","v141-b-g03-e07"],"rationale":"The exclusion of supply submissions and the mode of participation in which small DER adjust production after receiving prices belong to the same EcoGrid design; this exclusion is not extended to the external RP market."},{"connection_id":"v142-d-CON004","from_chain_id":"v141-c-R005","to_chain_id":"v141-c-R006","kind":"complementary_scope","from_refs":["v141-c-R005::phi::v141-c-R005-C001"],"to_refs":["v141-c-R006::phi::v141-c-R006-C001"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-ev01","v141-b-g01-ev09","v141-b-g01-ev12"],"rationale":"The source lists small end consumers and small DER together as price-responsive participants; the two chains cover entities with different demand and supply capabilities, retaining their respective nodes and constraints."},{"connection_id":"v142-d-CON005","from_chain_id":"v141-c-R004","to_chain_id":"v141-c-R005","kind":"functional_coupling","from_refs":["v141-c-R004::phi::v141-c-R004-C006","v141-c-R004::phi::v141-c-R004-C007","v141-c-R004::phi::v141-c-R004-C008","v141-c-R004::phi::v141-c-R004-C011"],"to_refs":["v141-c-R005::phi::v141-c-R005-C001","v141-c-R005::phi::v141-c-R005-C003"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-ev01","v141-b-g01-ev12","v141-b-g01-ev15","v141-b-g01-ev16","v141-b-g01-ev22","v141-b-g01-ev24"],"rationale":"The TSO publishes prices directly to participants in advance, enabling consumers to respond to them; alignment of price and metering intervals corresponds to the metering admission condition of the specified implementation. This mapping connects only existing activities and conditions."},{"connection_id":"v142-d-CON006","from_chain_id":"v141-c-R004","to_chain_id":"v141-c-R006","kind":"functional_coupling","from_refs":["v141-c-R004::phi::v141-c-R004-C008","v141-c-R004::phi::v141-c-R004-C011","v141-c-R004::phi::v141-c-R004-C012"],"to_refs":["v141-c-R006::phi::v141-c-R006-C001"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-ev01","v141-b-g01-ev12","v141-b-g01-ev22","v141-b-g01-ev24"],"rationale":"The real-time prices published to participants also serve as inputs to autonomous responses by small DER; the source supports the linkage between signal delivery and participation activities but does not guarantee that the actual response reaches the quantity expected by the TSO."}],"annotation_policy":"Original D connections are annotations, not additional S edges.","empty_after_chain_suppression":false});
